## Key Takeaways

Azure connectivity troubleshooting requires investigation across multiple layers.

A VM can be running normally while users remain unable to connect because of network security rules, routing configuration or operating-system firewall restrictions.

The exercise reinforced the importance of defence in depth and systematic troubleshooting.

